{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"oryocyph"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["agent","workflow"],"value":"Context: Working as a senior software engineer in one of the big techs.<p>One of the goals for senior engineers in my organization is to identify and implement AI initiatives.<p>I'm already familiar with and actively using MCPs, AI <em>agents</em>, plugins etc. While they've been useful, it feels like most people in my company are already working on this.<p>I was curious whether your organization has built or adopted any AI powered tools, <em>workflows</em>, or use cases that have delivered meaningful business value and could potentially be adapted by other organizations as well."},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"AI Goal: Senior Software Engineer"}}

